{
 "name": "M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, Chapter 1, Section E  - Processing Cases Involving Common Accidents in Service",
 "content": "<p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177988\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, Chapter 1, Section D  - Disability  or Death from Use of Alcohol, Drugs, or Tobacco Products\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177988?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">&lt;-- Previous Section</a>&nbsp; <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177990\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, Chapter 1, Section F  - Reversal of Prior Determinations Related to Character of Discharge (COD), Line of Duty (LOD), or Willful Misconduct\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177990?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">Next Section --&gt;</a></span></span></p><h2><a id=\"top\" name=\"top\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Overview</span></span></strong></a></h2><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong>In This Section</strong></span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\">\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">This chapter contains the topic \"<a href=\"#1\">Common Accidents in Service</a>.\"</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></div><h2><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">1<a id=\"1\" name=\"1\">.</a>&nbsp; Common Accidents in Service</span></span></strong></h2><p></p><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Introduction</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">This topic contains information on processing cases involving common accidents in service, including</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#1a\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">definition of a common accident</span></span></a></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><a href=\"#1b\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">jurisdiction for common accident cases</span></span></a></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">processing common accident claims by </span></span></div>\t\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#1c\">regional offices (ROs)</a>, and</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#1d\">Central Office (CO)</a>.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Change Date</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">August 19, 2021</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">X.iv.1.E.1.a<a id=\"1a\" name=\"1a\">.</a>&nbsp; Definition: Common Accident</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px\">\t\t\t<div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">A <strong><em>common accident</em></strong> is one in which information shows that the death of two or more service members occurred during noncombat service as a result of the same accident or disaster.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><em>Note</em></strong>:&nbsp; Accidents that occur in the air or at sea are <em>not</em> included in this definition.&nbsp; Do <em>not</em> treat deaths resulting from such accidents as deaths that resulted from a common accident.</span></span></div>\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><em>Reference</em></strong>:&nbsp; For more information on deaths in common accidents following separation from service, see <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000174198\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part XI, Subpart i, Chapter 2, Section B  - Finding of Fact and Date of Death\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000174198?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">M21-1, Part XI, Subpart i, 2.B.2.e</a>.</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">X.iv.1.E.1.b<a id=\"1b\" name=\"1b\">.</a>&nbsp; Jurisdiction for Common Accident Cases</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Establish jurisdiction for common accident cases on an individual case basis, except when otherwise specifically assigned by Central Office (CO).</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Reference</em></strong>:&nbsp; For more information on&nbsp;claims jurisdiction and transfer, see <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000174868\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part II, Subpart ii, Chapter 3 - Claims Jurisdiction and Transfer\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000174868?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">M21-1, Part II, Subpart ii, 3</a>.</span></span></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">X.iv.1.E.1.c<a id=\"1c\" name=\"1c\">.</a>&nbsp; Processing Common Accident Claims by ROs</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">The claim in any one common accident case may be adjudicated by the regional office (RO) without the need for reviewing any additional related cases or referring the case to CO, if</span></span></div>\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">the line-of-duty status is clear and there is no question of misconduct, and</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">a favorable determination is clearly warranted.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 115px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">X.iv.1.E.1.d<a id=\"1d\" name=\"1d\">.</a>&nbsp; Processing Common Accident Claims by CO</span></span></h3>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"height: 8px; width: 15px\"></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 516px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">The table below describes how CO processes claims in common accident cases when they are transferred by the RO.&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 496px\" summary=\"This is a stage-who is responsible-description table.  Column 1 is the stage number, column 2 is the responsible party, and column 3 provides a description of how CO processes claims in common accident cases when they are transferred by the RO.\" width=\"496\">\t\t\t\t<thead>\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 59px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong>Stage</strong></span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</th>\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 96px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong>Who Is Responsible</strong></span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</th>\t\t\t\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width: 349px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong>Description</strong></span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</th>\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t</thead>\t\t\t\t<tbody>\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 59px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">1</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 59px; vertical-align: top\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">RO</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 349px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Reassigns the electronic claims folder (eFolder) and any related cases located in the same office to CO (21C) for final determination, if a favorable determination as to line of duty or willful misconduct cannot be made on the evidence of record in a common accident case.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><strong><em>Reference</em></strong>:&nbsp; For more information on disaster and common accident cases, see <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000174198\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part XI, Subpart i, Chapter 2, Section B  - Finding of Fact and Date of Death\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000174198?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">M21-1, Part XI, Subpart i, 2.B.2</a>.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 59px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">2</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 96px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">CO</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 349px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Requests any other related cases.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Makes an administrative decision.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 59px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">3</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 96px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">CO</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 349px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Adds a copy of the administrative decision in each related eFolder.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\">Reassigns the eFolder to the RO for any necessary award or denial action.</span></span></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t</tbody>\t\t\t</table>\t\t\t<div></div>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><div style=\"margin-left: 85pt\"><hr /></div><p style=\"text-align: right\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\"><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177988\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, Chapter 1, Section D  - Disability  or Death from Use of Alcohol, Drugs, or Tobacco Products\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177988?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">&lt;-- Previous Section</a>&nbsp; <a class=\"eGainArticleLink\" articleid=\"554400000177990\" articlename=\"M21-1, Part X, Subpart iv, Chapter 1, Section F  - Reversal of Prior Determinations Related to Character of Discharge (COD), Line of Duty (LOD), or Willful Misconduct\" href=\"https://www.knowva.ebenefits.va.gov/system/ws/v11/ss/article/554400000177990?portalId=554400000001018&usertype=customer&\">Next Section --&gt;</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial , helvetica , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#top\"><span style=\"font-size: 11px\">To Top</span></a></span></p>",
